  <iati-identifier>XM-DAC-45001-C103</iati-identifier>
  <reporting-org ref="XM-DAC-45001" type="40">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Trade Centre (ITC)</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Responsible Business Conduct through due diligence and alignment of SMEs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project will scale up the alignment assessment of multi-stakeholder initiatives and individual companies and uptake of OECD Due Diligence Guidance. Building on the ITC Standards Map database and online portal, the project will map relevant multi-stakeholder initiatives and the OECD Due Diligence Guidance on Responsible Supply Chains in Garment and Footwear sector. ITC will then develop an online customized application that facilitates the self-assessment of multi-stakeholder initiatives (MSIs) against the due diligence guidance and support the official alignment assessment process. ITC will leverage the existing database of Standards Map to map the multi-stakeholder initiatives and OECD due diligence guidance, and assist MSIs with regards to data collection, maintenance, updates, and adaptations related to due diligence; self-assessment, review, and correspondence with OECD due diligence, application to official alignment assessment and uptake of due diligence by multi-stakeholder initiatives and individual companies.</narrative>
  </description>
